            <li><a href="#ten-and-fifteen">What Is 10% and 15% Incline on a Treadmill?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#levels">Incline Levels vs Percent: What Is Level 3?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#how-hard">How Hard Is 12% Incline? The 12-3-30 Link</a></li>
            <li><a href="#speed">What Speed to Use at 12% Incline</a></li>
            <li><a href="#how-to-set">How to Set 12% Incline on a Treadmill</a></li>
